[en.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION]
Expansion Construction

[en.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION_desc]
With the initial funding issue resolved, we can finally start expanding the diner. However, the follow-up funding issue still needs to be resolved — after all, all the profits from the first year were used to pay Cloudsdale.

[en.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YReturn to the Sky§!: §YStratusburg Brand§!.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION]
扩建工程

[zh.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION_desc]
解决了初步资金来源问题，我们终于可以开始扩建小餐馆了。然而，后续的资金来源问题仍然需要解决 — 毕竟第一年的收益全都被用来支付给云中城了。

[zh.FOCUS_C04_DINER_EXPANSION_CONSTRUCTION_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y重返天空§!中的决议：§Y层云堡品牌§!。

